    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 5: 希尔伯特变换",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            83,
            388,
            106
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$= \\int \\limits_{-{b0}}^{b0} f_{1}(t) f_{2}(t \\cdot 2)b$",
        "bbox": [
            728,
            40,
            968,
            83
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一个实值函数 $x(t)$ 的希尔伯特变换是 $x(t)$ 和 $1/\\pi t$ 的卷积。",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            114,
            643,
            137
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n= \\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} x | \\tau | \\cdot \\frac {1}{t - \\tau} d \\tau\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            700,
            94,
            950,
            139
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "假设 $x(t)$ 是一个实值函数，求该函数的希尔伯特变换。",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            144,
            620,
            163
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\hat {x} (t) = H [ x (t)) ] = x (t) * \\frac {1}{\\pi t} = \\left(\\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {x (\\tau)}{t - \\tau} d \\tau\\right)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            297,
            165,
            714,
            213
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\rightarrow  \\left\\lbrack  {h + 1}\\right\\rbrack   = {3}^{y + 1}$",
        "bbox": [
