        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (\\omega) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} - j & \\omega > 0 \\\\ j & \\omega <   0 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            400,
            109,
            591,
            147
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)求该相移器的单位冲激响应 $h(t)$ 。 $=\\frac{1}{\\pi t}$ (2)对于任意输入 $e(t)$ ，求该相移器的输出 $r(t)$ 。 $=e(t)\\times\\frac{1}{\\pi t}$ = $\\frac{1}{\\pi}\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\frac{e(\\tau)}{t-\\pi}d\\tau$",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            150,
            947,
            204
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)当 $e(t)=\\cos\\omega_{0}t$ 时求该相移器的输出 $r(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            203,
            571,
            236
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ne (t) \\xrightarrow {\\text {相位器}} \\boxed {- \\frac {\\pi}{2} r a d} \\xrightarrow {r (t) = \\hat {e} (t)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
