    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 45: 已知因果LTI系统频响特性 $H(\\omega)$ 的实部为 $\\pi\\delta(\\omega)$ ，求该系统的频响特性 $H(\\omega)$ 和单位冲激响应 $h(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            135,
            93,
            851,
            160
        ],
        "page_idx": 10
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\mathrm{if:}} \\\\ & {\\mathrm{and}} \\\\ & {\\frac {H (w) = R (w) + j \\lambda (w)}{R (w) = \\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {w} \\frac {\\lambda (\\lambda)}{w - \\lambda} d \\lambda}} \\\\ & {\\frac {x (w) = - \\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {2 (\\lambda)}{w - \\lambda} d \\lambda}{= - \\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- w} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {\\pi d (\\lambda)}{w - \\lambda} d \\lambda}} \\\\ & {\\quad = - \\frac {1}{w}} \\\\ & {H (w) = \\lambda d (w) - j \\frac {1}{w} = \\lambda d (w) + \\frac {1}{j w}} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow h (t) = u (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            127,
            150,
            921,
            625
        ],
        "page_idx": 10
    },
